  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>当前标准整星硬件设计基线</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Scenarios.DefaultSpacecraftDesignConfig</code>　<b>类型：</b>record</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>当前标准整星硬件设计基线</p><h3>配置与调用</h3><p>由使用者声明或传入本类型；记录与常量保存静态配置，不单独代表一套物理状态。修改设计输入后应通过项目既有离线配置入口生成生效快照。</p><h3>继承与复用</h3><p>本类的继承/别名声明如下。继承得到的端口、参数、状态和算法仍由被引用类定义，不重复增加一套行为。</p><pre>SpacecraftDesignConfig( communication=DesignConfigRecords.CommunicationDesignConfig( antenna=DesignConfigRecords.AntennaComponentConfig(PatchHeatCapacity=105,RFDeckConductance=0.14,MastOffsetZ=0.22,Mass=0.24,RCM_X=0,RCM_Y=0,RCM_Z=0.22,Inertia_XX=0.0028,Inertia_YY=0.0028,Inertia_ZZ=0.0004), baseband=DesignConfigRecords.BasebandComponentConfig(FPGALoadResistance=15,BoardHeatCapacity=175,MountConductance=0.4,Mass=0.34,RCM_X=0,RCM_Y=0,RCM_Z=0,Inertia_XX=0.0009,Inertia_YY=0.0012,Inertia_ZZ=0.0009), ttcReceiver=DesignConfigRecords.TtcReceiverComponentConfig(ReceiverLoadResistance=216,RFChokeResistance=0.05,HeatCapacity=165,MountConductance=0.36,Mass=0.38,RCM_X=0,RCM_Y=0,RCM_Z=0,Inertia_XX=0.0011,Inertia_YY=0.0014,Inertia_ZZ=0.001), xband=DesignConfigRecords.XbandComponentConfig(NominalDataRate=6250000,HighPerformanceDataRate=18750000,UseHighPerformanceDataRate=false,PowerAmplifierResistance=5.8,OutputMatchResistance=0.05,PAHeatCapacity=310,RadiatorConductance=0.65,Mass=0.62,RCM_X=0,RCM_Y=0,RCM_Z=0,Inertia_XX=0.002,Inertia_YY=0.0026,Inertia_ZZ=0.0018)), dataHandling=DesignConfigRecords.DataHandlingDesignConfig( obc=DesignConfigRecords.ObcComponentConfig(ProcessorLoadResistance=34.6,CPUHeatCapacity=185,BoardHeatCapacity=260,CPUBoardConductance=0.8,BoardMountConductance=0.45,Mass=0.46,RCM_X=0,RCM_Y=0,RCM_Z=0,Inertia_XX=0.0012,Inertia_YY=0.0015,Inertia_ZZ=0.0011), recorder=DesignConfigRecords.RecorderComponentConfig(CapacityBytes=128000000000,NANDLoadResistance=51.9,MemoryHeatCapacity= …（完整表达式见源码）</pre></html>"),
